  "method": "The analyser was run over the corpus before and after the repair with the same flags (--funnel --trials 4 --slice theta_hat@aggregate_coef_se), and the two findings sidecars were diffed by (rule, file, line, message, evidence). Fourteen allocation-size claims disappeared, twenty-nine claims appeared, and six findings stayed but carried a sharper length.",
